%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Merchant
    participant P as mobile / mp
    participant A as Tally apps/api
    participant S as Meta Model API
    participant Q as Qore Catalog
    participant D as Postgres (tally)

    M->>P: photograph shelf (thorough stock-take)
    P->>A: POST /api/businesses/:id/vision/stocktakes [multipart, Bearer JWT]
    A->>D: insert vision_agent_runs (running)
    A-->>P: 202 {runId}
    Note over A,D: In the background
    A->>S: first pass: muse-spark-1.3 read + sam-3.1 counts
    A->>Q: POST /v1/match (first pass)
    A->>D: step: baseline
    loop until submit_stocktake, no more tool calls, or 12 turns / 150 s
        A->>S: muse-spark-1.3 + tools, photo + checklist + history<br/>[store: false, encrypted reasoning replay]
        S-->>A: thoughts + tool calls (several per turn)
        par tools run together
            A->>A: zoom → close-up image back to the model
        and
            A->>Q: search_catalogue → /v1/match, retry wording
        and
            A->>S: count_units → sam-3.1
        and
            A->>A: find_in_store / record_line (checked)
        end
        A->>D: steps: thought + each tool call
    end
    A->>D: save scan + detections with evidence, finish run (done / fallback)
    loop every 1–2 s
        P->>A: GET …/stocktakes/:runId
        A-->>P: status, live step trace, result when done
    end
    M->>P: review, confirm
    P->>A: POST …/shelf-scans/:scanId/confirm (human sign-off)
